    {
      "id": "claim_3d0debb9e7c34641be679d7a2fc0c206",
      "statement": "The k-means backend raises when called without an explicit cluster count, stating that no default is assumed, because the number of process families is the parameter the study must justify rather than inherit from a library default.",
