    {
      "id": "claim_4a7ad1edb6a4439fbbd4555256484ce3",
      "statement": "The Leiden backend builds its own graph from cosine nearest neighbours with edge weights of one minus the distance floored at zero, then partitions it with the RB configuration objective at the requested resolution under a fixed seed.",
