    {
      "id": "claim_bf7c7a0c46814ee286181b4a2d91a2e7",
      "statement": "The consensus backend clusters the other partitions rather than the features, stacking one-hot label blocks scaled by the inverse square root of the number of algorithms and running k-means in that co-association space.",
