    {
      "id": "claim_fc9d79b208ff44488da792cb00cc8926",
      "statement": "In the co-association encoding a noise-labelled process contributes an all-zero row rather than a column of its own, so an unassigned process is not treated as evidence of agreement between algorithms.",
